    "created_at": "2026-07-24T10:33:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-24T10:33:54Z",
    "body": "Is it intentional that #selectedness-setting-algorithm [bails](https://whatpr.org/html/12430/56ec622...4bb6f73/form-elements.html#selectedness-setting-algorithm:~:text=If%20element%20%27s%20has%20the%20multiple%20attribute%20is%20absent%2C%20and%20attribute%2C%20then%20return%2E) for select multiple? Wouldn't this imply that selecting an `<option>` by script (which goes through [#ask-for-a-reset](https://whatpr.org/html/12430/56ec622...4bb6f73/form-elements.html#:~:text=ask%20for%20a%20reset,-given%20this)) is broken?",
